 "transportNote": "Fail fast, retry more. The SDK default timeout is 10 minutes, so the previous 3-attempt policy spent up to 30 minutes discovering a 25 KB request would never be answered -- the attn-control arm managed 4 turns in 26 minutes before exhausting its attempts. An agent turn on a small request either answers in seconds or not at all, so 180s x 6 attempts bounds a dead call at 18 minutes while giving twice the chances. sdkMaxRetries stays 0 so every attempt is one the harness made and counted."
